WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
    color: white;
    background-color: #383943A3;
}

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.784
Look – I'm not your dad.

00:00:01.784 --> 00:00:06.556
But 'I've done harder things hungover' isn't exactly
setting the bar high, is it?

00:00:06.556 --> 00:00:08.530
This is a job you actually want.

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:11.618
First impressions matter, not just to them, but to
you.

00:00:11.618 --> 00:00:14.206
How you show up on day one sets a certain tone, Maya.